🟠 ebs-csi-controller in kube-system (prod-eu-1) keeps crashing because it runs the volume attacher the pods wait for and has no ready pods. It fails with "csi-attacher: failed to run: leader election lost". Every app that uses it is failing. Affected: ledger in billing; db in shop.
Related alerts: 2 failed attach volume alerts
To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs deploy/ebs-csi-controller -c app -n kube-system --previous
Proof: both replicas fail, on 2 nodes.
